> I am setting up multiple Kafka Connect (KC) clusters on Amazon ECS, each =
with 2 nodes and one connector per cluster.
> When all KC clusters and connectors are created simultaneously, one of th=
e connectors unexpectedly restarts. The issue is reproducible with min of 4=
 clusters. One of the KC clusters connector is only restarted even the clus=
ter count is increased to 10.=C2=A0
> I am unable to determine the root cause of this restart. It seems that th=
e incremental balancing process is handling the request as if a configurati=
on update is present, even though no actual config changes have occurred du=
ring the connector's startup phase.
