David Jacot created KAFKA-18916:
-----------------------------------

             Summary: Resolved regular expressions must update the group by topics data structure
                 Key: KAFKA-18916
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18916
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
            Reporter: David Jacot
            Assignee: David Jacot
             Fix For: 4.0.0


When regular expressions are resolved, they do not update the group by topics data structure. Hence, topic changes (e.g. deletion) do not trigger a rebalance of the group.



