Hi Xuan-Zhang
Thanks for the KIP. I have a few questions.

TC0: It seems that we don't have default allow list in the KIP. As Chia
mentioned, we should add a default one. Moreover, we should also update the
"Compatibility, Deprecation, and Migration Plan" section. We should use
default allow list for processing, not the disallowed list.

TC1: Perhaps we should add javadoc for deprecated field and new filed, it
would good for understanding.

TC2: Public Interface section should also metion adding new field and
deprecated field.

Best,
TengYao

Chia-Ping Tsai <chia7712@apache.org> =E6=96=BC 2025=E5=B9=B43=E6=9C=886=E6=
