PoAn Yang created KAFKA-18937:
---------------------------------

             Summary: Consider to add kraft state to BootstrapMetadata
                 Key: KAFKA-18937
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18937
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: PoAn Yang
            Assignee: PoAn Yang


Currently, BootstrapMetadata only supports FeatureLevelRecord. The "kraft.version" feature is stored in KRaftVersionRecord, so it's not in BootstrapMetadata. We can consider to add "kraft.version" to BootstrapMetadata, so we can have all bootstrap features information in it.

Followup from: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18685#issuecomment-2704663862



