Hi everyone,

I'd like to start a discussion thread on *KIP-1141*, which proposes a
relatively small but useful change:

simplifying the *MetadataQuorumCommand* by leveraging the Admin API for
adding and removing controllers.

You can find the details here: https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/PZFEF.

I believe this proposal could provide a better user experience,

and I=E2=80=99d really appreciate it if you could take a look and share you=
r
thoughts or feedback.

