Hi,
In order to better monitor how the election happens, I propose to add a new
metric kafka.controller:type=3DControllerStats,name=3DEligibleLeaderReplica=
sElectionsPerSec.
It counts the election that chooses the replica from ELR members. This new
metric together with an existing
metric kafka.controller:type=3DControllerStats,name=3DUncleanLeaderElection=
sPerSec
can recognize the non-ISR elections.
Thanks

