    Resolution: Fixed

> ShareGroupHeartbeat and ShareGroupDescribe API must check topic describe
> ------------------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-18817
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18817
>             Project: Kafka
