Hi Juma and Chia-Ping,

Thanks for the review and suggestions.

chia_q0: I change KIP to deprecate listenerName function in 4.1 and =
replace it with name function.
In 5.0, the deprecated function listerName will be removed.

chia_q1: Add RaftVoterEndpoint and =
StreamsGroupMemberDescription#Endpoint as examples to explain that
different cases use different Endpoint definitions. The listenerName =
cannot be null in broker side and there is
no usage in client side, so we can deprecate listenerName function and =
use the name function to return String.

Best Regards,
PoAn

