> 3) replace `org.apache.kafka.common.Endpoint` by =
`org.apache.kafka.network.Endpoint`
>=20
> in 5.x
>=20
> 1) remove `org.apache.kafka.common.Endpoint#listenerName()`
>=20
> Best,
> Chia-Ping
>=20
