hi PoAn

Considering that the Endpoint API is now considered stable, would you please =
create a minor patch to remove the @InterfaceStability.Evolving annotation? T=
his annotation was introduced in version 2.4.0 (see https://github.com/apache=
/kafka/commit/364794866f82d2d99f7a610d699478d5055688f0), and its removal shou=
ld be straightforward at this point.

Best,
Chia-Ping

