David Arthur created KAFKA-19000:
------------------------------------

             Summary: Flaky test report should use absolute time for links
                 Key: KAFKA-19000
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19000
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: build
            Reporter: David Arthur


The links generated by the flaky test report use the default "last 7 days" =
time range. This means if you click a link in the report, it will show you =
the current "last 7 days" instead of the 7 days that were used to generate =
the report data.

=C2=A0

We should modify the links to use absolute time based on when the report ra=
n



