Hi,

>>>>> The evolving annotation was left by mistake given that
>> these
>>>>> classes have been there for a long time by now.

I misunderstood evolving annotation, so I tried to change listenerName =
from
Optional<String> to String at the first version. Change to deprecate =
listenerName
in 4.1. I will include removing evolving annotation
in https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/19191, so I will not create a =
minor PR for it.

> I think `name` is a bit too generic. Perhaps
> `listener` would be a better option for the non deprecated method =
name.

Change to use `listener` to return String.

Thanks,
PoAN

