                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19011
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


the EndToEndLatency tool is used to test the latency of data transmission from producer -> broker -> consumer.

The metrics are important to all kafka users. However, the tool is a bit out-of-date. for instance,

1. it does not use argument parser
2. it can't define the key and header



