tIndex(); ([here|https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/cf7029c0264fd7f7b15c2=
e98acc874ec8c3403f2/core/src/main/java/kafka/log/remote/RemoteLogManager.ja=
va#L1772])

*Thread - 2 index cache thread*

Entry is marked for cleanup i.e physical offset index file is renamed.

*Thread - 3 remote-log-index-cleaner*

Physical offset index file is deleted.

*Thread - 1 remote-log-reader*

Attempts run binary search on the MappedByteBuffer that is mapped to a non-=
existent file.

long upperBoundOffset =3D offsetIndex.fetchUpperBoundOffset(startOffsetPosi=
tion, fetchSize).map(position -> position.offset).orElse(segmentMetadata.en=
dOffset() + 1); ([here|https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/3.8/core/src/ma=
in/java/kafka/log/remote/RemoteLogManager.java#L1619])

=C2=A0

