Hi Stig

Sorry for the late reply, and thanks for your question. =F0=9F=98=80

The title "Upgrade slf4j to 2.x" represents the core change enabling
improved logging backend selection.
The fundamental change is the SLF4J upgrade, which brings the new provider
selection mechanism (`-Dslf4j.provider`) as a key feature.
Given that, I think the current title reflects the primary technical
change, while the KIP details explain the resulting benefits and
implementation approach.

Best,
TengYao


