Hi everyone

I have updated the content of KIP.
I want to highlight that although we set log4j2 as the default server-side
logging framework we couldn't change its scope to implementation in
`build.gradle`.
This will lead the downstream projects to encounter dependency conflicts.

Please take a look and share your feedback.

Best,
TengYao

