Hi All,

I've opened a new KIP-1149: Helm Chart for Apache Kafka<https://cwiki.apach=
e.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1149%3A+Helm+Chart+for+Apache+Kafka> wit=
h the proposal to have an official Helm chart to deploy Apache Kafka to Kub=
ernetes.

The initial Jira ticket (KAFKA-6416<https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/K=
AFKA-6416>) requesting this was created back in 2018, but now that the proj=
ect has an official Docker container image it would now seem appropriate to=
 have a matching Helm chart.

There is a draft PR<https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/19249> in Github w=
ith an initial stab at defining the solution for this.

I look forward to seeing the discussion on this.

Regards,

Stephen.

