hi Clayton

Thanks for your suggestion.

IIRC, System.Logger is primarily used within the JDK itself, and therefore
lacks extensive APIs. Additionally, I am uncertain whether all SLF4J
providers support System.Logger. If they do not, it will present a
significant issue, given our long-standing use of SLF4J.

Best,
Chia-Ping

