hi Kirk

> KT2. Is the intention that the client layer will still use Endpoint? If so,=
 the new listener() method will return null, yes? My concern is that develope=
rs of the client will lose the Optional safeguard with this change.

Given that the client layer utilizes org.apache.kafka.common.Endpoint within =
the Authorizer, the endpoint object supplied to the Authorizer must never con=
tain a null listener.

Best,
Chia-Ping

=20

