cs that do
> > > > not have keys.
> > > > > there is no fundamental reason that a topic without ordering g=
uarantees
> > > > needs to produce to a specific partition - why not just choose t=
he broker
> > > > in the closest zone?
> > > > > if all of your traffic is unkeyed, then this can further reduc=
e Kafka=E2=80=99s
> > > > network cost by 25%.
