> > > > We've seen the strong trend in the industry of trading off laten=
cy for
> > > > cost reduction. Namely - almost every vendor has introduced some=
 sort of
> > > > leaderless Kafka API model that outsources replication to a remo=
te store
> > > > cost[2][3][4][5]. This in turn allows them to reduce cross-zone =
