> > > > costs to literally zero. In certain optimized deployments the ne=
tworking
> > > > cost can be up to 80-90% of the total cost![6] KIP-392 allows us=
 to
> > > > eliminate the consumer-side traffic cost, but there is great mot=
ivation to
